Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:01:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 23/27] Card markings found in more shapes: a table indexed
 from the image base, a flag read again after each marking, a marking that
 ends in a copy of the method's ending

On a commercial Unity 6000.0.60f1 game this removes the barriers left after stores to fields of
locals, array elements and static fields: Assembly-CSharp 2,697 -> 2,743 complete bodies,
marker sites 1,778 -> 1,351, with no complete body lost.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
